{"root":{"data":{"text":"信息技术学科专业知识","background":"#974706","color":"#ffffff","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy0975r8tko","created":1531727987336,"text":"信息系统","background":"#4f81bd","color":"#ffffff","layout":null,"font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09dpa7ugw","created":1531728001577,"text":"概述","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96ly52uu80","created":1785138004985,"text":"计算机组成与程序设计语言的发展：\n第一代电子管 机器语言和汇编语言\n第二代晶体管 操作系统和高级语言\n第三代集成电路 \n第四代超大规模集成电路","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96mxis4000","created":1785138082001,"text":"全文检索：指计算机索引程序通过扫描文章中的每一个词，\n对每一个词建立一个索引，指明该词在文章中出现的次数\n和位置，当用户查询时，检索程序就根据事先建立的索引\n进行查找，并将查找的结果反馈给用户的检索方式（百度、Google）\n目录搜索检索：按照级别，逐级查询，代表的搜索引擎有新浪、雅虎\n元搜索：没有自己的数据库，代表网站是360\n不存在特色信息检索引擎","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkmksxqbgdk0","created":1786498327617,"text":"冯诺依曼结构：程序存储执行以及计算机由五个部分组成（运算器、控制器、存储器、输入设备、输出设备）","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkmkuqcd1ow0","created":1786498468264,"text":"哈佛结构：CPU、程序存储器、数据存储器","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09eb3zu8s","created":1531728002897,"text":"计算机系统","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96fggd0280","created":1785137496300,"text":"数值与编码","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96q6dvf4g0","created":1785138336387,"text":"国标码是是用于汉字信息处理系统之间或者与\n通信系统之间进行信息交换的汉字代码，简称交换码","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf1t984w80","created":1785568056884,"text":"汉字的机内码仅用于表示汉字的编码，通常用两个字节进行存储。\n字型码用于显示汉字的点阵数据，存储的是汉字的具体形状，其大小取决于点阵规格","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf2j12ktc0","created":1785568112988,"text":"异或运算的规则：相同为0，不同为1","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96fiep7fk0","created":1785137500553,"text":"安全及维护","background":"#b8cce4","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96qamzmmw0","created":1785138345646,"text":"常见的信息安全基本属性（特征）主要有机（保）密性、\n完整性、可用性、抗抵赖（不可否认）性和可控性等，\n此外还有真实性、时效性、合规性、隐私性等。","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf25y76yg0","created":1785568084516,"text":"数字签名是将要明文利用私钥签名和公钥加密后再发送，\n在接收端通过公钥验证和私钥解密后得到明文","background":"#b8cce4","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09a2gllsg","created":1531727993667,"text":"新技术及应用","background":"#f79646","layout":null,"color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09f949og0","created":1531728004953,"text":"物联网","background":"#fde9d9","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"color":"#000000","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96qm8tdlc0","created":1785138370910,"text":"物联网的相关关键技术：无线传感器网络，ZigBee，\nM2M技术，RFID技术，NFC技术，低能耗蓝牙技术","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf2v74wow0","created":1785568139476,"text":"机器人控制系统主要由传感器、控制器和执行器三部分组成","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g1g2l1s0","created":1785137541995,"text":"大数据","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g2oikvc0","created":1785137544682,"text":"云计算","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g412eug0","created":1785137547618,"text":"人工智能","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","expandState":"collapse","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96r4h7pnc0","created":1785138410600,"text":"人脸识别的工作过程，大致经过如下的阶段。\n（1）数据采集：首先，收集与问题相关的人脸数据。\n（2）数据预处理：这一步骤旨在减少数据中的噪声和冗余，并提高后续处理步骤的效果。\n（3）特征提取：从预处理的数据中提取有意义的特征，\n并选择最相关和区分能力强的特征。\n（4）匹配与识别：将提取出的特征与数据库中的人脸特征进行匹配，以识别个体的身份。","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96r8mehcg0","created":1785138419621,"text":"生成对抗网络：是一种生成模型，通过对抗训练，\n能够生成与真实数据分布相似的合成数据，\n在医学领域常被用于生成合成图像或数据，\n特别是在数据缺失或隐私保护的情况下\n卷积神经网络：是一种深度学习模型，擅长处理图像、\n语音等具有局部结构的数据，如特征提取、分类等任务","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96g5096iw0","created":1785137549746,"text":"扩展现实","background":"#fde9d9","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09aghjj4k","created":1531727994515,"text":"办公软件","background":"#c00000","layout":null,"color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09gzuisgg","created":1531728008746,"text":"Word","background":"#d99594","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"color":"#000000"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96gng1tc00","created":1785137589883,"text":"Excel","background":"#d99594","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96gpmr3ds0","created":1785137594642,"text":"PPT","background":"#d99594","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bmy09auqwd4c","created":1531727995377,"text":"多媒体技术","background":"#92d050","layout":null,"color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bmy09juo6nks","created":1531728014963,"text":"概述","background":"#c2d69b","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96h5cb7eg0","created":1785137628839,"text":"图形图像基础","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf3m4j0iw0","created":1785568198091,"text":"图像文件大小（字节）＝图像分辨率×颜色深度÷8","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf3ta97c80","created":1785568213675,"text":"像素数量=分辨率×尺寸","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96h75i8940","created":1785137632781,"text":"音频基础","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf3aq3x0o0","created":1785568173275,"text":"音频文件大小（字节）= 采样频率 × 量化精度 × 声道数（是否为双声道/立体声，若是则×2） × 时间 ÷8","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96h8vm6hk0","created":1785137636536,"text":"视频基础","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96h9z6fa80","created":1785137638929,"text":"PS基础","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf71pbeeo0","created":1785568467092,"text":"若存在多个图层，加黑锁的图层不可删除。图层加的是白锁，可以删除。","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96havr3d40","created":1785137640898,"text":"Flash基础","background":"#c2d69b","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96a9j5f6o0","created":1785137089410,"text":"计算机网络技术","background":"#ffc000","layout":null,"color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96hrngg600","created":1785137677402,"text":"概述","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf86dok680","created":1785568555637,"text":"双绞线两端线序排列不同，可分为直通线（直连互联法）和交叉线（交叉互联法）。\n直通线两头的排序标准一样，用于不同的设备相连；交叉线两头的排序标准不同，相同的设备相连用交叉线。","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96ht3hcxs0","created":1785137680548,"text":"网络体系结构","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkmkx22wflc0","created":1786498650541,"text":"OSI七层模型：\n应用层：为计算机用户提供服务\n表示层：数据处理（编解码、加密解密、压缩解压缩）\n会话层：管理（建立、维护、重连。应用之间的会话）\n传输层：为两台主机进程之间提供数据传输服务（段）\n网络层：路由和寻址（决定网络游走的途径）（数据包/报）\n数据链路层：帧编码和误差纠正控制（数据帧、元素）\n物理层：透明地传送比特流传输","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkml38z18so0","created":1786499135730,"text":"分支主题","image":"","imageTitle":"","imageSize":"","hyperlink":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_44772566/article/details/136717134","hyperlinkTitle":"一文彻底搞懂OSI七层模型和TCP/IP四层模型","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkml4szyq8g0","created":1786499257686,"text":"TCP/IP模型：\n应用层：处理用户与网络应用程序之间的通信（HTTP、FTP、SMTP）\n传输层：提供端到端的数据传输服务（TCP可靠传输、UDP简单传输）\n网络层：数据包的路由和转发（IP）\n网络接口层：管理网络硬件设备和物理媒介之间的通信（以太网、WIFI、蓝牙）","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96hunhtnc0","created":1785137683935,"text":"数据通信技术","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdezxv9nvk0","created":1785567910196,"text":"发送的比特串由数据位和冗余位共同组成。冗余位的位数为多项式的最高阶。","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkdf48szgww0","created":1785568247459,"text":"信道复用技术分为频分复用、时分复用、波分复用、码分复用\n频分复用（FDM）：用户在分配到一定的频带后，在通信过程中自始至终都占用这个频带。频分复用的用户在同样的时间内占用不同的频率带宽。\n时分复用（TDM）：就是将提供给整个信道传输信息的时间划分成若干时间片（简称时隙），并将这些时隙分配给每一个信号源使用。\n波分复用（WDM）：实质就是光的频分复用，光纤传输多种不同波长（频率）的光信号，波长不同，各路光信号互不干扰。\n码分复用（CDM）：是靠不同的编码来区分各路原始信号的一种复用方式。","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96hw8xhvc0","created":1785137687408,"text":"internet协议及应用","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf52f43wg0","created":1785568311924,"text":"地址解析协议（ARP）：由IP地址获取对应的MAC地址\nDNS：由域名获取IP地址\nDNS反向域名解析：由IP地址获取域名\nRARP：由MAC地址获取IP地址","background":"#c4bc96","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96i5xebfc0","created":1785137708478,"text":"网络组建技术","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96ibvkmo80","created":1785137721428,"text":"网页设计基础","background":"#c4bc96","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96acc7wjk0","created":1785137095522,"text":"数据结构与算法","layout":null,"background":"#8064a2","color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96j29d6pc0","created":1785137778859,"text":"算法基础","background":"#b2a1c7","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96j3uznkg0","created":1785137782343,"text":"数据结构","background":"#b2a1c7","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96j5kp9xs0","created":1785137786074,"text":"程序设计","background":"#b2a1c7","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96af3248g0","created":1785137101498,"text":"数据库技术","layout":null,"background":"#4bacc6","color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96jf7dnko0","created":1785137807037,"text":"数据库基础","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96jkfx1aw0","created":1785137818437,"text":"数据模型","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96jlfpnso0","created":1785137820601,"text":"关系数据库","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf5fxrscw0","created":1785568341350,"text":"关系数据库中，表与表通过公共字段建立联系，并且公共字段类型要保持一致。实现表与表之间的联系是通过参照完整性","background":"#b6dde8","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96jn3byu80","created":1785137824206,"text":"Access数据库","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96jp57dio0","created":1785137828673,"text":"SQL基础","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96jqbbp9k0","created":1785137831220,"text":"关系数据库的设计","background":"#b6dde8","font-weight":"bold","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96agyxrow0","created":1785137105602,"text":"程序设计Python","layout":null,"background":"#1f497d","color":"#ffffff","font-size":18},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk96kfhvyns0","created":1785137886036,"text":"Python程序基础","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96kj7qecg0","created":1785137894129,"text":"选择结构程序设计","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96klrbkts0","created":1785137899667,"text":"循环结构程序设计","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96kp34o200","created":1785137906912,"text":"序列","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk96kqa2cyw0","created":1785137909508,"text":"函数","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkdf5ui2isw0","created":1785568373052,"text":"eval()函数功能是将数值型字符串的类型转为数值型","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk96krcapy00","created":1785137911820,"text":"独立编程","background":"#8db3e2","color":"#000000","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"classic-compact","version":"1.4.43"}